        "created_at": "2013-11-12T16:46:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Mezike\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Mezike:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>byc wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Can Akash'Bhuta be an environment in the future?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;And a hero too please! Then Akash'Bhuta can fight Akash'Bhuta in Akash'Bhuta.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><em>twitch</em>&nbsp; \"stop hitting yourself\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(edit – my post is mostly nonsense, but slightly less so with the quote I meant to attach…)</p>",
