        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-12T19:32:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I was right!&nbsp; I <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/sneaky-vengeance-preview-in-time-cataclysm-4137\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">said</a> that at least one of the environments would be either a villain HQ or a hero HQ - and they're BOTH!&nbsp; Very excited to see Freedom Tower.But I have to ask - if you fight Baron Blade on the Mobile Defense Platform, and you destroy the Mobile Defense Platform he starts the game with, does the Environment deck go away?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Of course not. That would be silly <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
