        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-12T20:32:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sometimes having to stretch the narrative like that becomes awesome (The Chairman in the Final Wasteland?&nbsp; He's basically Lord Humungus, ruling with an iron fist over the last enclave of humanity).&nbsp; But other times, it's lame (The Chairman in Insula Primalis?&nbsp; What the hell?&nbsp; I picture the Crooked Cops trying to direct stegosaur traffic.)</p>",
